@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 用户名可用性
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/username/check?username=testuser123

### 用户名已占用
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/username/check?username=existinguser

### 手机校验
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/phone/check?phone_country_code=%2B86&phone_number=13812345678

### 创建会话
POST {{baseUrl}}/registration/sessions

### 提交账户信息（将下面的 session_id 替换为上一步返回值）
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/registration/sessions/{{session_id}}/account
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser123",
  "password": "MyPass_123",
  "name": "张三",
  "id_type": "居民身份证",
  "id_number": "110101199001011234",
  "phone_country_code": "+86",
  "phone_number": "13812345678",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "traveler_type": "成人"
}

### 发送短信验证码
POST {{baseUrl}}/registration/sessions/{{session_id}}/sms/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone_country_code": "+86",
  "phone_number": "13812345678"
}

### 验证短信（成功）
POST {{baseUrl}}/registration/sessions/{{session_id}}/sms/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "123456"
}

### 身份核验（成功）
POST {{baseUrl}}/registration/sessions/{{session_id}}/identity/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id_type": "居民身份证",
  "id_number": "110101199001011234",
  "name": "张三"
}

### 条款确认
POST {{baseUrl}}/registration/sessions/{{session_id}}/terms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "terms_version": "v2025.11_服务条款",
  "privacy_version": "v2025.11_隐私权政策",
  "accepted": true
}

### 完成注册
POST {{baseUrl}}/registration/sessions/{{session_id}}/complete